{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:55ce4397f54872f7ad722bf6ecfecb91515ccb335e063ed95fbb3fc707d0be44",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45c8eccb47f30d99152904a6984983cacd5fd8f078282368e3fc8a54b4ebebb0",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●●●●●●●监督？\n刚才我和悠介一起看了最后一集播出哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:959676ca354a6e1cdfb78b257fa411679f18386ec1d09e7a62dc1333443de8d2",
      "text": "和小孩子们处好了关系，\n每次都是超级开心的现场呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9459774ca70bebfd57eeebdc3d036a211effce697a0a62a5e4531148137e770c",
      "text": "说起来，这是录制刚开始不久时候的\n事了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d309097d70526c6c1f052f25c6d9e832bf2aa01f8207dd76c37f96fc69b67ddb",
      "text": "当时有个孩子怎么也融不进大家的圈子里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7d197c93c08650b8d9988ae92dc7de0462517e0b7941bfe8786a914115ddbbc",
      "text": "我也很在意，\n不过特别是悠介，主动上去跟他搭话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c96d4bbfdd47fad0aa5f8f984a9d1c8f5ba6074549e83830050b137eac874842",
      "text": "结果不知不觉间，那个孩子也融进大家\n的圈子里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2711d67610006b4913ab7aec1c46df30c84f87c187573929b62daeb1e49477ec",
      "text": "遇到其他好像快要吵起来的孩子，\n也是悠介主动上前搭话，带给大家笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ec1561e82d570fe2091e9d8820b6641f8948d2f3dd3db4024aa0fa95635ad62",
      "text": "真的，悠介就是个气氛活跃者呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa2c912691ffc25815ab4b23d58e63214ece8c32b5e8ac8627143e77f05c2380",
      "text": "真是个可靠的\n哥哥呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5114d9a000d4dccbd81f437c5d0cd64f9e755515739d02d32e3c061d566d9397",
      "text": "嗯，我也经常受到悠介的帮助。\n不知不觉就总是依赖他呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f47ce8c7fc7fd8974134c8a0a9e967da08e3a5efcd1ed9f223932758f39e6047",
      "text": "啊，刚才那句话可别跟悠介说哦。\n他绝对会得意忘形的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_305_2_3_013_05_09_a:2_3_013_05_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e92b062399372275a2e39a54d8424f448e16d7bd8d97006cf469eadae4de7f90",
      "text": "那就再见啦，\n●●●●●●●●●●监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
